SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EET: Narva Art Residency (NART): Tallinn University 
 Artistic Research Fellowship 2027 (two months in Narva\, EUR 1\,500 stipen
 d plus production and travel)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 28 Dec 2026 at 23:59 EET.\n\nA two-month artistic resear
 ch fellowship at Narva Art Residency (NART) in Narva\, on Estonia's border
  with Russia\, run with Tallinn University.\n\nOrganisation: Narva Art Res
 idency (NART) and Tallinn University\nLocation: Narva Art Residency (NART)
 \, Narva\, Estonia. In residence. Open to artists from all art fields and 
 all parts of the world.\nAward: Fellowship grant of EUR 1\,500\, a product
 ion and materials budget of up to EUR 1\,000\, travel reimbursement of up 
 to EUR 500\, and free accommodation and workspace at NART. No application 
 fee mentioned.\nDuration: 2 months (1 May to 30 June 2027)\n\nMore: https:
 //nart.ee/en/open-call-tallinn-university-artistic-research-fellowship-at-
 nart/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
